						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=991.msg9812#msg9812"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/recycled.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=991.msg9812#msg9812">Re: Rodcet Nife Allstars</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #19 on:</b> August 07, 2004, 02:51:54 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Corse I made no list /cry:<br />My best would be..<br />Tanks - Honch, Barun, Heaton, Grem, Garadan, Mdien, Kaiyne, Demott, Kaidog, Daewood ,Zilkorn(sp), Sineral, Wranglersan, Jeet, Olegunner(sadly makes my list <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />), and Phad best agro management and snap agro on mobs from the groups Ive been in with them. <br />Damage/Pulling - Fysts, Ssnakess, Baelt, Glayde, Kjunspice, Shadobane, Moslow, Thugs, Poxli, Galuden, Sigg, Shillin, throw in some wizards cause they all have werid names, Kered(seen him do things ive never seen another necro do),Leanan, Roinin, Baranox, Gagram, Eaglesky, Moonwind, Swiftfeet, Matteo, and Baka based on pulling and damage and soloing things that people just dont solo that I have personally seen. As a cleric and a rogue I rarely grouped with Wizards and cant think of anynames, kinda the same for necros I would say, aside from Kered.<br />Healing - Chauey, Shib, Katia, Aellis, Odesa, Thecklous, Sylina, Doctress, Kilaer, Pegi, Reyem, Darkdoc, Crestus, Flavius, Lantuss, and Vanden these were the clerics and druids that most impressed me in skill as a Cleric and a Rogue. Spent lots of time in several guilds on the sever and can say I learned alot from these folks as healers and in general. <br />Slow/CC - Mazzar(by far to me best chanter I ever grouped with), Karadana(by far best shaman I grouped wtih), Braeylia(sp), Treyn, Efrin(sp), Willhelm, Serepi, Mother, Kurtzu, Fletchera, Dissonant, Alyna, Labyrrinth, and Averiel.<br />Granted Im leavin alot of people out but Im biased on the fact that most of my eq life I grouped mainly with 5 other people I&#039;d say out almost 5 years of playin 2 and 1/2 of those years I grouped with Shillin or Ssnakess, Karadana, Kaiyne, Ranax or Leanan, and Mazzar.<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
