							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Eh I&#039;ll try to keep it as far from my guild as possible.<br /><br />Bard - Kaneh, Cococo<br />Beastlord - Darmuth<br />Berserker - The one that never existed<br />Cleric - Falelar, Emtae, Iife, Darkdoc, Kohl, Capital<br />Druid - Aellis (havent really met her but she is worth mentioning if she solos all the things she is said to have) Ganthor, Maion, Goldraven, Tobulas, Xixixi, Ninamas, Spellit<br />Enchanter - Sarumon, Seaweed, Enchantingvixen, Astretia<br />Mage- Alienz (I think that&#039;s it dunno about this guy&#039;s skill but I remember watching him on a kedge keep raid once and that was when I decided to make a mage)<br />Monk - Xath, Xarsis, Eski, Wormias (used to have good times making fun of him for being human) Waun (the only person I have ever met in paludal and felt the urge to continue a conversation, he has a main in UoP but ive since forgotten the name)<br />Necro - No real necros come to mine but /shrug I guess OA necros and Shadowpact<br />Pal - Anyone that BSSs me and Jeet<br />Ranger - Kolen, Cabralain, Neaienie<br />Rogue - Cudget, Artor, Jazzmine, Kuoto (I agree with Dommie on those) Akarion<br />Shaman - Juggledezz, Mindoleyk, Mistan, Tennus<br />SK - Iope, Wickett<br />War - Kinsonn (love him or hate him, hes a damn good warrior) Qintus, Sineral, Bonbons<br />Wiz- Hmm can&#039;t think of any off the top of my head, Brokenfang I guess.<br /><br />AND OF COURSE: Gnos (May I get a cookie?)
