							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 104<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=174"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=991.msg9844#msg9844"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=991.msg9844#msg9844">Re: Rodcet Nife Allstars</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #24 on:</b> August 08, 2004, 02:20:28 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Another one of these. I&#039;m going to go by whoever I remember and try to remain neutral. The people I have least contact with are newer members of DA/EiE... remember people like Jeet to some degree from way back when at least, whereas people who joined them during the last 2 years are total unknowns to me.<br /><br />Oh this is also a sort of collective effort. People present are me/Kariena/Vesi/Lumilla/Baelt/Aellis/Erfin<br /><br /><br />Warrior:  Vesi (though somewhat unreliable during farming), Dyvim (even more unreliable during)<br />Monk:    Aaliel, Kimdoohan<br />Rogue:   Bippon   (other good ones existed, but they were more like his students than anything else... he figured out ways to pull that none had tried before)<br /><br />Bard:     Baelt (he seemed to pull about 50% faster than the fastest DA/EiE pullers, though them using SKs and stuff for pulling seemed hilarious while I played... guess their bards suck)<br /><br />Ranger:  uh... playskill wise I don&#039;t really think any rangers shone out. I know many of those mentioned here, and I haven&#039;t been impressed. Shar probably of those I know.<br />SK:        Mallagin/Bagbokk of those that I&#039;ve played with, though Blyte and Sazzabi have gotten a lot of praise<br />Paladin:  hard to say... lots of good ones, but none truly spectacular  (good ones include Demott, Garadan, Kaiyne etc)<br />Beastlord:  couldn&#039;t really tell, hardly notice wtf they do<br />Berserker: huh?<br /><br />Druid:     Aellis was best that Ascent had, though Fenani was great too. Aellis still did the minmax and was the first druid to solo a great many mobs as serverwide firsts.<br />Shaman: Reia. Handled Emperor room np enough by himself, which had AL shammies boggling. Was our only shaman playing for such a long time.<br />Cleric:     Not the hardest of classes really, and I don&#039;t think there&#039;s a truly &quot;great&quot; cleric. Lumilla, Chauey, Odesa were imo the least fuck-up prone of Ascents clerics.<br /><br />Enc:       Vosh did the most with the class of any enc I&#039;ve played with. Lots of great enchanters other than him though (Clar, Braelyia the best that I can recall in Ascent)<br />Mage:    Very hard to stand out in this class again. Can&#039;t think of any way a mage could be superior to other mages.<br />Necro:    Kered for reigning CoD when most people had trouble 6manning there (and he wasn&#039;t even getting hit significantly, so no excuses with his gear level)<br />Wizard:   Xanthorian  (regardless what people said about Utamara, Xanth ALWAYS parsed a whole fuckload more damage than he/she/it did)<br /><br /><br /><br />Oh going to add a few more categories:<br />Best multiboxer:   Mcbashin. He 6boxed Tipt with his twinks while DA/EiE had people failing at them and FoT had maybe one <br />                         group through the bloody thing.<br />Best understanding of the game:  Vesi/Reia/Bippon... maybe throw in Baelt as well. There&#039;s no real competition here from the other guilds, confirmed by reading their<br />                        boards for such a long time :P&nbsp; (and of course me being above that bunch!)
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: August 08, 2004, 06:03:32 pm by Delheru</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
